| name = Spectral Dagger
| desc = Procs [[Empower Spell]] regardless of its {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} ability targeting type.
}}
{{Morphnotes
| name = Spectral Dagger
| desc = All ability effects are nullified upon losing the ability.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Spectral Dagger
| desc = All ability effects are nullified upon losing the acquired ability.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Spectral Dagger icon0}}
| desc = Spectre flings a dagger to draw a Shadow Path, dealing damage and slowing the movement speed of any enemies along the trail. Units hit by the dagger also trail a Shadow Path. While treading the path, Spectre moves faster and phases through otherwise impassable terrain.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Spectral Dagger basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|spectre_spectral_dagger}}
** The number of debuff reapplication attempts, or {{M|Spell Block}} source procs, is affected by the following conditions:
*** When Spectre, the primary target and the secondary target are in a straight line, the debuff will be reapplied 11 and 10 times on the secondary target with a 24-{{M|bound radius}} and an 8-bound radius respectively.
*** The debuff will be reapplied 8 times when the secondary target touches, but does not intersect with, the Spectral Dagger path.

