 {{Illucraft|name=Spectre Shadow Step}}

* {{Symbol|Shadow Step}} {{Symbol|Illusions}}
** All ability components considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|illusion}} as heroes, {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
** The Shadow Step-based [[illusion]] has the following properties:
*** Can be selected, but uncontrollable.
*** Has {{M|unobstructed movement}}.
*** Not affected by {{M|vision}} increasing sources.
*** {{Symbol|Attack Damage}}
**** The created illusions attempt to attack their corresponding targets, and attack their targets when they have {{M|vision}} over them.
**** If their corresponding targets cannot be attacked, they home in to the targets close enough until they can be attacked again, including when the targets are affected by the following sources:
***** Moves into the {{M|Fog of War}}.
***** {{M|Hidden}}
***** {{M|Invisibility}}
***** {{M|Invulnerability}}
*** The illusion bounty is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|{{G|illusion bounty level factor}} × [[Illusion#Bounty|Illusion]]<sub>LVL</sub>}}

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*#* The first created illusion has the following properties:
*#** Appears {{Code|58-distance}} in front of Spectre upon cast, and homes to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy in {{#var:Shadow Step value2}}-speed.
*#** The first illusion duration is defined as:
*#*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|AbilityDuration × 2}}
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage}}
*#* The second illusion duration refreshes the first illusion duration upon a successful attack on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy from the Shadow Step-based illusion.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Shadow Step icon0}}
| desc = Sends an uncontrollable illusion at a target that follows and attacks the target.<br><br>The Reality sub-ability may be used to teleport to the illusion, destroying it.
}}
* {{Symbol|Shadow Step}} {{Symbol|Illusions}}
** Hence, the Shadow Step-based illusion has a max {{calc|v1+v2|v1={{#var:Shadow Step value3}}|v2={{#var:Shadow Step type1 value4}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1+v2|v1={{#var:Shadow Step value3 tal}}|v2={{#var:Shadow Step type1 value4 tal}}}}|15tal}})-second duration.

* For other units utilizing this ability, the Shadow Step-based {{M|illusion}} spawn distance has the following values correspondingly its {{M|collision size}}:
{{Colsizecard}}

